  "translation": {
    "english_title": "Even if we draw a curtain and hide our love",
    "sections": [
      {
        "ordinal": 1,
        "source_label": "ராஜா",
        "english_label": "Raja",
        "pdf_pages": [9],
        "source_tamil_lines": [
          "திரைபோட்டு நாமே மறைத்தாலும் காதலை",
          "தெளிவாக நாளை தெரியாமல் போகுமோ?"
        ],
        "english_lines": [
          "Even if we ourselves draw a curtain and hide our love,",
          "Will it fail to become clear tomorrow?"
        ],
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 2,
        "source_label": "ராணி",
        "english_label": "Rani",
        "pdf_pages": [9],
        "source_tamil_lines": [
          "சரியான நேரம் கிடைக்காத போதிலே",
          "திரைபோட்டுக் காப்பதே முறையாகும் வாழ்விலே"
        ],
        "english_lines": [
          "When the right time has not yet come,",
          "In life, the proper way is to guard it behind a curtain."
        ],
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 3,
        "source_label": "ராஜா",
        "english_label": "Raja",
        "pdf_pages": [9],
        "source_tamil_lines": ["சரியான நேரம் என்னேரமோ!"],
        "english_lines": ["And what time is the right time!"],
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 4,
        "source_label": "ராணி",
        "english_label": "Rani",
        "pdf_pages": [9],
        "source_tamil_lines": ["அலை மோதும் நெஞ்சம் நிலைகாணும் நேரமே!"],
        "english_lines": ["The time when a wave-tossed heart finds steadiness!"],
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 5,
        "source_label": "ராஜா",
        "english_label": "Raja",
        "pdf_pages": [9],
        "source_tamil_lines": ["சந்தோஷம் காணவே தடை போடலாமோ?"],
        "english_lines": ["Can one place an obstacle in the way of finding happiness?"],
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 6,
        "source_label": "ராணி",
        "english_label": "Rani",
        "pdf_pages": [9],
        "source_tamil_lines": ["தவறாக என்னை எடை போடலாமோ?"],
        "english_lines": ["Can you weigh and judge me wrongly?"],
        "notes": ["The source's weighing image `எடை போடலாமோ` is retained rather than flattened to `misunderstand me`."
        ]
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 7,
        "source_label": "ராஜா",
        "english_label": "Raja",
        "pdf_pages": [9],
        "source_tamil_lines": ["அரும்பான காதல் மலராகுமோ?"],
        "english_lines": ["Will love that is still a bud become a flower?"],
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 8,
        "source_label": "ராணி",
        "english_label": "Rani",
        "pdf_pages": [9],
        "source_tamil_lines": ["குறும்பான கேள்வி இது நியாயமாகுமோ?"],
        "english_lines": ["This mischievous question—is it fair?"],
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 9,
        "source_label": "ராஜா",
        "english_label": "Raja",
        "pdf_pages": [9],
        "source_tamil_lines": ["கரும்பாக பேசும்!"],
        "english_lines": ["Speak as sweetly as sugarcane!"],
        "notes": ["The sugarcane sweetness image is kept concrete."]
      },
      {
        "ordinal": 10,
        "source_label": "ராணி",
        "english_label": "Rani",
        "pdf_pages": [9],
        "source_tamil_lines": ["என்னாசை ராஜா!"],
        "english_lines": ["Ennaasai, Raja!"],
        "notes": ["The verified joined form `என்னாசை` can carry more than one conversational parsing; it is transliterated rather than silently normalized."
